---
title: "P03 API proxy request authorization"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: platform processing
    lg1: platform rejection
    lg2: business
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 purple
  s0: Ready for next request
  s1: Raw path and query parsed
  s2: Rejected: no unique route
  s3: One operation uniquely matched
  s4: Rejected: operation disabled
  s5: Operation whitelist passed
  s6: Business request executed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a caller sends the proxy request
  s1 --> s2: the proxy rejects the request [when no route is unique]
  s1 --> s3: one raw template wins [when static precedence makes it unique]
  s2 --> s0: the proxy records the result and takes the next request
  s3 --> s4: the proxy rejects the operation [when any whitelist layer disables it]
  s3 --> s5: overrides, profile, and instance all allow the operation
  s4 --> s0: the proxy records the result and takes the next request
  s5 --> s6: the proxy executes with raw path and query preserved
  s6 --> s0: the proxy records the result and takes the next request
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 orange
  class s3 blue
  class s4 orange
  class s5 blue
  class s6 purple
